component "Final bounded inventory receipt\nselected inert metadata names" as RESULT <<app>>
component "Latched failure\nkill / observed close / FD cleanup" as ERROR <<error>>
CALLER ARROW_MAIN FILE : independently expected root/file snapshots and content pin
FILE ARROW_MAIN FIRST : same FD, exact positional reads
FIRST ARROW_MAIN SECOND : hash match before any decoder starts
SECOND ARROW_MAIN DECODER : hash supplied bytes again; finish stdin at physical EOF
DECODER ARROW_MAIN TAR : expanded bytes bounded before parsing
TAR ARROW_MAIN RESULT : joint EOF/status/close/hash/metadata/FD success only
DECODER ARROW_ERROR ERROR : error, output/stderr cap or original deadline
TAR ARROW_ERROR ERROR : malformed/unsupported TAR or selection cap
FILE ARROW_ERROR ERROR : short read, mutation, hash or close failure
